<title>BELGIUM: U.K. ESPRIT, FIBERNET IN DATA ACCORD.</title>
<headline>U.K. ESPRIT, FIBERNET IN DATA ACCORD.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.K.-based, European telecommunications company Esprit Telecom Group Plc said in a statement on Wednesday it had reached an agreement with data communications company Fibernet which enables it to expand services offered in the Thames Valley area of Britain.</p>
<p>&quot;The Fibernet solution adds value for our customers, while meeting Esprit Telecom's objective to cost-effectively grow the company's network bandwidth and to meet the increasing demand for our telecoms solutions throughout Europe,&quot; Esprit managing director Jonathan Hudson said.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not given.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
